title: "capiQ: Computational Automation Pipeline for Hydro-morphodynamic simulation Queues"
abstract: >-
  capiQ is a Python-based Computational Automation Pipeline for Hydro-morphodynamic
  simulation Queues, designed to configure, manage, and execute large batches of
  BASEMENT simulations efficiently.
